        "raw": "<p>Everyone is going to play a ton of SotM this weekend, so I figured this would be a great time for an event. This event is simple. All we need to do is play SotM for 48 hours straight. Just sign up <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/11MqwaSx3Y1sTQw7NYXKxXBahlEjTO1DiVkbL_xy780E/edit?usp=sharing\">here</a> with your planned, or unplanned, games, and let&#39;s see if we can get it filled (all times are St. Louis times). If you want to not start on the hour, just add a line for your start time. If multiple people play at the same time, just add more names to the right. We can do this!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
